  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Training",
   "texto": [
    "It is formed with the present subjunctive of **avoir** or **être** + past participle: **que j'aie fini** (which is finished), **que tu sois venu** (which you have come).",
    "With **être** the participle matches the subject: **que tu sois venue** (if you are a woman)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
